=You are writing a follow-up email for Mark Vitale, a real estate agent in the Capital Region of New York (Albany, Schenectady, Troy, Saratoga Springs). Mark works with Vera Cohen Realty.

This is drip stage {{ $('Split Into Individual Leads').item.json.drip_stage }} for a {{ $('Split Into Individual Leads').item.json.tier }} lead.

Lead info:
- Name: {{ $('Split Into Individual Leads').item.json.name }}
- Property interest: {{ $('Split Into Individual Leads').item.json.property_interest }}
- Original message: {{ $('Split Into Individual Leads').item.json.message }}
- Timeline: {{ $('Split Into Individual Leads').item.json.timeline }}
- Buyer or seller: {{ $('Split Into Individual Leads').item.json.buyer_seller }}

Current Capital Region market snapshot:
- Median price: ${{ $('Fetch Latest Market Data').item.json.median_price || '285,000' }}
- Average days on market: {{ $('Fetch Latest Market Data').item.json.avg_dom || '38' }} days
- Months of supply: {{ $('Fetch Latest Market Data').item.json.months_of_supply || '1.8' }}

Drip sequence template to use as inspiration (adapt it, don't copy verbatim):
Subject hint: {{ $('Split Into Individual Leads').item.json.subject_template }}
Body hint: {{ $('Split Into Individual Leads').item.json.body_template }}

Write a personalized follow-up email that:
1. References their specific situation naturally
2. Includes ONE relevant market data point for the Capital Region
3. Feels like it came from a real person, not a system
4. Has a single soft call-to-action
5. Is 120-180 words
6. Does NOT mention being an automated follow-up

Return ONLY valid JSON in this exact format with no markdown or explanation:
{
  "subject": "<email subject line, max 50 chars>",
  "body": "<full email body starting with Hi [Name],>"
}

parameters.jsCode:
const ollamaResponse = $('Ollama - Generate Drip Email').item.json.response;
const lead = $('Split Into Individual Leads').item.json;

let emailData;
try {
  const cleaned = ollamaResponse.replace(/```json/g,'').replace(/```/g,'').trim();
  emailData = JSON.parse(cleaned);
} catch(e) {
  // Fallback: use template directly
  emailData = {
    subject: lead.subject_template.replace('{{name}}', lead.name),
    body: lead.body_template
      .replace('{{name}}', lead.name)
      .replace('{{property_interest}}', lead.property_interest || 'the Capital Region')
      .replace('{{avg_dom}}', '38')
  };
}

const signature = `

Best,
Mark Vitale
Licensed Real Estate Agent | Vera Cohen Realty
(518) 533-8775 | realtormarkvitale.com`;

return [{
  json: {
    lead_id: lead.id,
    lead_email: lead.email,
    lead_name: lead.name,
    subject: emailData.subject,
    body: emailData.body + signature,
    new_drip_stage: (parseInt(lead.drip_stage) || 0) + 1
  }
}];

